An '''Atoll Croaker''' is a {{Common}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
An '''Atoll Croaker''' can be fished up anywhere on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} once the player is {{skill|fishing|10}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Atoll Croaker''' is {{Green|5,000}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|50%|1|2|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase its weight:

